5	## Overview of APIs
6	The L3 APIs are the complete beamformer composed of the units provided in L2. There are three types of beamformer provided: SA, PW and ScanLine.
7	
8	### ScanLine Beamformer
9	
10	This beamformer is a variant of the one used in PW where the difference consists in the receiver delay computation. As the graph is obtained by the composition of L2 libraries, it will have the summation of the components in I/O of the L2 libraries:
